  -> LocalClusterMap copies sparse historical_pg_routes
  -> local reconstructed_pg_route_at_epoch(epoch)
  -> stale <= route selected
  -> read/cleanup/repair/backfill goes to wrong shard location
  -> NotFound/unavailability; no proven auth or confidentiality impact
